  "behaviour": [
    "Start: the server computes the amount from price-book (current version, promotion end date) and the subject's state, creates Payment(started), calls Paystack initialize with amount in kobo and our reference.",
    "Verify: on return from Paystack and on webhook, the server calls Paystack verify; only a verified success with matching amount, currency and reference moves the payment to succeeded.",
    "Webhook: HMAC-SHA512 of the raw body with the Paystack secret key must equal x-paystack-signature; otherwise 401 and nothing is done. Events are stored once by event id; repeats are acknowledged and ignored.",
    "Idempotency: Idempotency-Key on start returns the first result for a repeat; fulfilment (seal, keep, pass, plan, credits) runs exactly once per succeeded payment, inside the same transaction as its ledger rows.",
    "A wish unlocks the moment Paystack confirms (T-73). A paid wish that fails to be delivered gets a refund (refunds).",
    "Started payments not completed are marked abandoned by a job.",
    "Replaces STUB-1 (confirm after 700 ms)."
  ],
